   {IF API detected:} - .claude/docs/API.md ✓
   {IF TESTING detected:} - .claude/docs/TESTING.md ✓
   {IF COMPLEX detected:} - .claude/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md ✓

🔗 Framework: .claude/CONVENTIONS.md {✓ / ⚠️ missing}
```

