| Element | iOS | Android |
|---------|-----|---------|
| **Primary Font** | SF Pro / SF Compact | Roboto |
| **Min Touch Target** | 44pt × 44pt | 48dp × 48dp |
| **Back Navigation** | Edge swipe left | System back button/gesture |
