### File Type Ownership

| File Pattern | Owner Agent | Others BLOCKED |
|--------------|-------------|----------------|
| `**/*.test.{ts,tsx,js}` | `test-engineer` | ❌ All others |
| `**/__tests__/**` | `test-engineer` | ❌ All others |
