```

## Speech Generation (TTS)

### Available Models

| Model | Quality | Speed | Cost/1M tokens |
|-------|---------|-------|----------------|
| `gemini-2.5-flash-native-audio-preview-09-2025` | High | Fast | $10 |
| `gemini-2.5-pro` TTS mode | Premium | Slower | $20 |

### Basic TTS

