| 9:16 | 768×1344 | Mobile, portraits | 1290 |
| 4:3 | 1152×896 | Traditional media | 1290 |
| 3:4 | 896×1152 | Vertical posters | 1290 |

All ratios cost the same: 1,290 tokens per image.

