    f.write(image_data)
```

### Cost Optimization

**Token costs**:
- 1 image: 1,290 tokens = $0.00129 (Flash Image at $1/1M)
- 10 images: 12,900 tokens = $0.0129
- 100 images: 129,000 tokens = $0.129

