## Domain Dependencies

Some domains depend on others and must be enabled in order:

```
Runtime (no dependencies)
  ↓
DOM (depends on Runtime)
  ↓
CSS (depends on DOM)

Network (no dependencies)

Page (depends on Runtime)
  ↓
Target (depends on Page)

Debugger (depends on Runtime)
```

