## Element Interaction

### Selectors

```javascript
// CSS selectors
await page.$('#id');
await page.$('.class');
await page.$('div > p');

// XPath
await page.$x('//button[text()="Submit"]');

// Get all matching elements
await page.$$('.item');
await page.$$x('//div[@class="item"]');
```

### Click Elements

```javascript
