# Plugin Marketplace Schema

## Marketplace JSON Structure

```json
{
  "name": "company-tools",
  "owner": {
    "name": "DevTools Team",
    "email": "devtools@example.com"
  },
  "metadata": {
    "description": "Brief marketplace description",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "pluginRoot": "./plugins"
  },
