## Accessibility

### Provide Labels

**Icon-only buttons:**
```tsx
<button aria-label="Search">
  <i className="ri-search-line"></i>
</button>

// Or with React
<button aria-label="Search">
  <RiSearchLine size={20} />
</button>
```

### Decorative Icons

Hide from screen readers:

```tsx
<span aria-hidden="true">
  <i className="ri-star-fill"></i>
</span>

// React
