## Overview

The CafeKit framework contains **86 skills** (including sub-skills) organized into 20 categories. Each skill has:

- **Trigger Words**: Keywords that activate the skill
- **Input Patterns**: Example user requests that trigger the skill
- **Processing**: What the skill does when activated
- **Output**: The results produced by the skill

