- Monitoring + support: 2 hours
- Survey creation + distribution: 2 hours
- Analysis: 3 hours

### Week 2: Analysis + Planning (18 hours)
- Interviews: 5 hours
- Feedback analysis: 4 hours
- v0.2.0 planning: 4 hours
- Bug fixes: 4 hours
- Preparation: 3 hours

### Week 3: Development + Release (27 hours)
- Development (P0+P1): 11 hours
- Testing: 2 hours
- Documentation: 2 hours
- Beta release: 2 hours
- Final fixes: 2 hours
