```
Day 1: Launch → Day 5: Survey → Days 8-9: Interviews 
  → Day 10: Analysis → Day 11: Lock features 
  → Days 15-17: Development → Day 19: Beta 
  → Day 21: Release
```

**Blockers:**
- Day 5 survey must complete before Day 10 analysis
- Day 11 features must lock before Day 15 development
- Day 19 beta must complete before Day 21 release

